## Another Common Issue
Sometimes people install Gunicorn in a virtual environment but run systemd as another user, so it cannot access the path.
If that happens change:
User=root
or
User=ubuntu
depending on your server user.

Quick Check (Important)
Run this manually first:
/root/My_CRM/venv/bin/gunicorn --bind 0.0.0.0:8000 crm.wsgi:application
If this command runs, Gunicorn is installed correctly.

