If you want to create a user in your Django project (for admin login), you need to create a superuser.

Follow these steps. 👇

1️⃣ Go to Your Project Folder
cd ~/My_CRM

Activate virtual environment:

source venv/bin/activate
2️⃣ Create Superuser

Run:

python manage.py createsuperuser

You will be asked:

Username:
Email address:
Password:
Password (again):

Example:

Username: admin
Email: admin@gmail.com
Password: ********

After success you will see:

Superuser created successfully.
3️⃣ Access Admin Panel

Open browser:

http://YOUR_SERVER_IP/admin

Example:

http://43.205.136.192/admin

Login using the credentials you created.

4️⃣ If You Get Error (Database Not Migrated)

Run migrations first:

python manage.py migrate

Then create superuser again.

5️⃣ Check Admin Enabled

In settings.py make sure:

INSTALLED_APPS = [
    'django.contrib.admin',
]

