You are at the domain selection step of Certbot. This means it detected your domain from the Nginx configuration. Good progress 👍

Your screen shows:

1: www.devk.co.in
What You Should Do

Since there is only one option, just type:

1

and press Enter.

(or you can just press Enter without typing anything to select all).

Next Step

After selecting the domain, Certbot will ask:

1: No redirect
2: Redirect HTTP to HTTPS

Choose:

2

This will automatically redirect HTTP → HTTPS.

Example:

http://www.devk.co.in  →  https://www.devk.co.in
After Installation

If successful, you will see something like:

Congratulations! You have successfully enabled HTTPS.

Now your site will work with:

https://www.devk.co.in
Test Your Website

Open in browser:

https://www.devk.co.in

